        {
            "id": 6662719,
            "title": "〈台股風向球〉外資期貨做空未轉向前 題材股輪動維繫多方熱度",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>在台股連4周走跌合計重挫20%後，國安基金宣布進場，使本周<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>強彈達3973點，收復5日線和10日線短期均線，漲幅達10%，下檔有撐的氣氛逐漸轉強，但又遭逢黃仁勳事件，令來回波動相當大，台股交易員提醒，外資期貨淨空單續增至已超過10萬口，隨著美股有壓，仍要注意短線有獲利者出場造成的壓力，若有行情先以個股或族群表現為主流。</p></section><p></p><div class=\"c1hvmcli\"><figure><div class=\"iirgi4a\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6662719/l/3bea50318fb45cc7ba569a0d84b0ac1d.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\">法人認為外資期貨做空未轉向前，先靠題材股輪動維繫多方熱度。(鉅亨網資料照)</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>上周<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>反彈達10%，不過，外資仍賣超968億元與內資投信對作，呈現連7周賣超，主要賣超中鋼(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2002:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2002\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2002-TW</a>)和仁寶(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2324:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2324\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2324-TW</a>)均超過6萬張，力積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6770:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6770\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6770-TW</a>)和大成鋼(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2027:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2027\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2027-TW</a>)均逾4.6萬張，英業達(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2356:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2356\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2356-TW</a>)達3.2萬張，廣達(-TW)2.1萬張，元大台灣50正2(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00631L:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00631L\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00631L-TW</a>)近1.9萬張，台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)和正新(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2105:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2105\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2105-TW</a>)均達1.7萬張。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>反觀投信仍維持買超力道，本周主要集中在大型電子股和金控股，有助穩住大盤漲點，一周來買超中信金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2891:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2891\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2891-TW</a>)近5.4萬張，南亞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1303-TW</a>)4.2萬張，元大台灣50(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:0050:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/0050\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">0050-TW</a>)近3萬張，國泰金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2882:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2882\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2882-TW</a>)和富邦金(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2881:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2881\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2881-TW</a>)均逾2萬張，元大台灣50正2達1.6萬張，台積電近1.5萬張，台玻(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1802:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1802\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1802-TW</a>)1.2萬張，日月光投控(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3711:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3711\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3711-TW</a>)逾8000張。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台股交易員認為，九合一大選前的選前行情可望使大盤明顯具備下檔支撐，然而美股電子股因黃仁勳事件仍是餘波蕩漾，且大盤在過去一周大漲10%後面臨月線和季線的反壓，較好狀況是先量縮整理、多頭以題材股維持輪動熱度。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>永豐投顧指出，<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>處在月線、季線與半年線下方，月線與季線走勢向下正在形成壓力，均線排列仍未明朗，但是KD 指標上已交叉向上，在此位階很可能盤整；整體而言，短線反彈仍屬跌深後的修復階段，尚未重回多頭結構。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>從籌碼面來看，外資 10 月賣超創下歷史單月新高，但在反彈過程卻未出現外資買超回補，從過往經驗來看，新波段的開始往往伴隨外資回補，因此需等外資轉買，加上<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/forex/detail/usdtwd\">新台幣</a>止貶回升帶動更多海外資金回流台灣。</p></section></main>",
            "link": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6662719",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-14 23:48:58",
            "source": "cnyes",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
